                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Wakefit's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Sleep science + quality positioning + D2C convenience + 100-night trial + Bangalore + national expansion + category expansion into home. Multi-dimensional home + sleep D2C leadership.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new mattress + sleep brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in specific specialty (specific-material + specific-concern + specific-demographic). Category continues expanding + international brands entering.</p>
                                        <h3>Is 100-night trial essential for mattress D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — removes buying risk for high-AOV + high-consideration purchase. Casper (USA) + Wakefit (India) + Emma (Europe) all use trial.</p>
